# fcc cobalt: coupled Monte Carlo sampling of the spins and molecular dynamics
# of the atoms
#
# fix mc/spin moves the spins, including their magnitudes (modulus walk),
# with the Landau energy of fix landau/spin; fix nve and fix langevin
# integrate and thermostat the atoms at the same temperature.  The spin
# sweeps are done after the atoms move and before the forces are computed,
# and the spin pair styles add their magneto-elastic forces.

units           metal
atom_style      spin
atom_modify     map array
boundary        p p p

lattice         fcc 3.54
Lattice spacing in x,y,z = 3.54 3.54 3.54
region          box block 0.0 6.0 0.0 6.0 0.0 6.0
create_box      1 box
Created orthogonal box = (0 0 0) to (21.24 21.24 21.24)
  1 by 2 by 2 MPI processor grid
create_atoms    1 box
Created 864 atoms
  using lattice units in orthogonal box = (0 0 0) to (21.24 21.24 21.24)
  create_atoms CPU = 0.000 seconds

mass            1 58.93
set             group all spin/atom/random 31 1.72
Setting atom values ...
  864 settings made for spin/atom/random
velocity        all create 300 4928459 mom yes loop geom

pair_style      hybrid/overlay eam/alloy spin/exchange 4.0
pair_coeff      * * eam/alloy Co_PurjaPun_2012.eam.alloy Co
pair_coeff      * * spin/exchange exchange 4.0 0.0446928 0.003496 1.4885

neighbor        0.1 bin
neigh_modify    every 10 check yes delay 20

fix             landau all landau/spin -0.3 0.05
fix_modify      landau energy yes
fix             mc all mc/spin 300.0 48279 cone 30 modulus walk modsigma 0.1
fix             lat all langevin 300.0 300.0 0.1 48280
fix             nve all nve

timestep        0.001

compute         mag all spin
compute         smag all property/atom sp
compute         savg all reduce ave c_smag
variable        magnorm equal c_mag[4]

thermo          50
thermo_style    custom step temp v_magnorm c_savg pe press f_mc[1] f_mc[3]
thermo_modify   format float %20.15g

run             500
